---
type: readme
title: Charlie example test payment data README
summary: Explains that the charlie.example.test webpay payment method redirects to david.example.test/webpay, analogous to google.com/pay redirecting to pay.google.com.
---

The payment method https://charlie.example.test/webpay redirects to
https://david.example.test/webpay, similar to how https://google.com/pay
redirects to https://pay.google.com/about.
